  ## Demo
Watch the full run (n8n execution, live Instagram post, and Google Sheet update): [https://www.instagram.com/reel/DePRNQ6zHKc/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&stkn=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==]

## Notes
- Captions include five relevant hashtags and keywords, generated by Google Gemini.
- Replace every `YOUR_...` placeholder in the workflow JSON with your own values.
- Images are hosted on Cloudinary. Put your image URL path in the Facebook Graph API node.
